00:32:37.460 --> 00:32:39.660
Oh, okay. Like Fire Emblem.

00:32:40.040 --> 00:32:49.240
Gotcha. Yeah. So I was definitely seeing it as like a cross between a standard like three on three.

00:32:49.420 --> 00:32:52.080
Just press attack or spells or whatever RPG.

00:32:52.360 --> 00:32:55.120
And like a tactical game.

00:32:55.120 --> 00:32:58.700
Game. But I do have a lot of complaints here.

00:32:59.320 --> 00:33:03.280
