00:33:16.740 --> 00:33:18.340
Like I think in any other.

00:33:18.580 --> 00:33:20.400
Like in tabletop RPGs.

00:33:20.480 --> 00:33:22.760
You can move. And then you can do a thing.

00:33:22.760 --> 00:33:24.840
