01:56:16.700 --> 01:56:17.720
I got to sleep at the inn.

01:56:17.800 --> 01:56:22.480
I'm going to go fight some skeletons to get enough gold to then sleep at the inn for the day.

01:56:22.640 --> 01:56:24.680
